  "brain_first": "按原文查阅 It, There be, Emphasis, Inversion, Ellipsis",
  "sort_order": 1087,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It 作形式主语/宾语",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2902
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· It is important to check the source.",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2903
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· It is clear that the plan needs more time.",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2904
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· I find it useful to make a checklist.",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2905
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "There be",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2906
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· There is a reason. / There are two reasons.",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2907
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· There seems to be a problem.",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2908
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 避免写 *There have many students*；应为 There are many students 或 Many students have...",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2909
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "强调句（基础）",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2910
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It is/was + 被强调部分 + that/who + 其余。例如 It was Tom who found the key. 基础学生写作不必强行使",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2911
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "用。",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2912
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "倒装（基础识别）",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2913
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Only then did I understand...",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2914
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Never have I seen...",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2915
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Not until later did he realize...",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2916
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Here comes the bus.（不同类型，不要混为一谈）",
      "sourcePage": 113,
      "sourceIndex": 2917
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "省略与替代",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2918
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· If possible, arrive ten minutes early. = If it is possible...",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2919
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· I chose the blue one. one 替代前文可数单数名词。",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2920
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Some students agreed; others did not. did not = did not agree。",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2921
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "优先级：特殊句式要会识别，但基础薄弱阶段不要拿它们挤占时态、非谓语、定语从句、词性转换等核心",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2922
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "时间。",
      "sourcePage": 114,
      "sourceIndex": 2923
    }
  ],
